# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (see com.hakios.demo.plist).
# sb_cube/sb_debug's windows of their own (11-10): touches under the cube's window must reach the home screen. A tap on
# Calendar (under the cube's window) then home, a tap on Settings (outside it, the control) then home; cputop says which
# applications started (MobileCal, Preferences). RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.overlay.
/redwood/bin/cputop 5 &
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 45 tap 0.37 0.375 wait 10 button home wait 5 tap 0.37 0.80 wait 10 button home wait 4
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 60
